{"tail":"לְדָוִד מִזְמוֹר. לַ"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ייָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" הָאָרֶץ וּמְלוֹאָהּ תֵּבֵל וְיֹשְׁבֵי בָהּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּי הוּא עַל־יַמִּים יְסָדָהּ. וְעַל־נְהָרוֹת יְכוֹנְנֶהָ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מִי־יַעֲלֶה בְהַר "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":". וּמִי־יָקוּם בִּמְקוֹם קָדְשׁוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"נְקִי כַפַּיִם וּבַר לֵבָב. אֲשֶׁר לֹא־נָשָׂא לַשָּׁוְא נַפְשִׁי וְלֹא נִשְׁבַּע לְמִרְמָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יִשָּׂא בְרָכָה מֵאֵת־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":". וּצְדָקָה מֵאֱלֹהֵי יִשְׁעוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זֶה דּוֹר דֹּרְשָׁו. מְבַקְשֵׁי פָנֶיךָ יַעֲקֹב סֶלָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שְׂאוּ שְׁעָרִים רָאשֵׁיכֶם וְהִנָּשְׂאוּ פִּתְחֵי עוֹלָם. וְיָבוֹא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מִי זֶה מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד. "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" עִזּוּז וְגִבּוֹר "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" גִּבּוֹר מִלְחָמָה: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שְׂאוּ שְׁעָרִים רָאשֵׁיכֶם וּשְׂאוּ פִּתְחֵי עוֹלָם. וְיָבֹא מֶלֶךְ הַכָּבוֹד: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/24/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
